<title>UK: Kuwait ups Q3 crude to Europe, U.S. unchanged - KUNA.</title>
<headline>Kuwait ups Q3 crude to Europe, U.S. unchanged - KUNA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum Corp (KPC) has raised term crude prices to European buyers and left prices to customers in the U.S. unchanged, said Kuwait News Agency, OPEC news agency reported.</p>
<p>KPC raised third quarter prices to Europe to Arab Medium plus 15-20 cents.</p>
<p>U.S. prices were left unchanged at parity with Arab Medium.</p>
<p>On Monday traders said KPC cut prices to Asia by 10 cents to Arab Medium -20 cents.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
</text>
